From 51f9b1771f14b71b0ef8184e61bced46370540da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Mar 2021 10:54:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 063/196] Add BIP341 sighash support to bitcoin-tx (#116)

Now sign=x|BIP341|FORKID and sign=x|BIP341|FORKID|ANYONECANPAY can be used.

Note: The BIP341 signatures are still invalid due to SigHashType::isDefined returning false, therefore the tests have signatures ending in 6x or ex instead of [x|BIP341|FORKID] etc.
This will need to be changed once SigHashType::isDefined allows BIP341 sigs.
